Author: AI Teammate <agent.ai.native@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 28 11:35:17 2026 +0000

    gh-1934 rework: killall functional probe gate + public API rename

    - test/env: gate the killall-by-comm leg behind a functional killall -0
      probe (gh-1934 CI red on a867a562: some images ship killall via a
      multicall coreutils dispatcher that cannot kill by comm name); build
      the test victim from a copy of sh (a copied multicall sleep dies on
      dispatch before killall can match it)
    - rename payloadCariesImageBytes -> payloadCarriesImageBytes and
      lastPayloadCariedImages -> lastPayloadCarriedImages (review thread
      PRRT_kwDOTXdlLc6xFrSr: misspelled barrel-exported API)

